## Delta Lake Samples
In this folder there are samples taken from the delta.io quickstart guide and docs. They are available in both Scala and Python and can be run if the presidens are satisfied.

### Preview
* See [Set up Apache Spark with Delta Lake](https://docs.delta.io/latest/quick-start.html#set-up-apache-spark-with-delta-lake).

### In
* To run an Sample on Python run `spark-submit --packages io.delta:delta-spark_2.12:{Delta Lake version} PATH/TO/EXAMPLE`
* To run the Scala Samples, `cd Samples/scala` and run `./build/sbt "runMain Sample.{Sample class name}"` e.g. `./build/sbt "runMain sample.Quickstart"`
